Ontology(<http://example.org/rule4>

Declaration(Class(<http://example.org/rule#A>))
Declaration(Class(<http://example.org/rule#D>))
Declaration(Class(<http://example.org/rule#E>))
Declaration(NamedIndividual(<http://example.org/rule#a>))
############################
#   Classes
############################

# Class: <http://example.org/rule#A> (<http://example.org/rule#A>)

